[TURN 8] [TIMESTAMP 2026-05-27T05:03:15.702Z]
[USER]:
1	# Gong MCP Server
2	
3	A Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that provides access to Gong's API for retrieving call recordings and transcripts. This server allows Claude to interact with Gong data through a standardized interface.
4	
5	## Features
6	
7	- List Gong calls with optional date range filtering
8	- Retrieve detailed transcripts for specific calls
9	- Secure authentication using Gong's API credentials
10	- Standardized MCP interface for easy integration with Claude
11	
12	## Prerequisites
13	
14	- Node.js 18 or higher
15	- Docker (optional, for containerized deployment)
16	- Gong API credentials (Access Key and Secret)
17	
18	## Installation
19	
20	### Local Development
21	
22	1. Clone the repository
23	2. Install dependencies:
24	   ```bash
25	   npm install
26	   ```
27	3. Build the project:
28	   ```bash
29	   npm run build
30	   ```
31	
32	### Docker
33	
34	Build the container:
35	```bash
36	docker build -t gong-mcp .
37	```
38	
39	## Configuring Claude
40	
41	1. Open Claude Desktop settings
42	2. Navigate to the MCP Servers section
43	3. Add a new server with the following configuration:
44	
45	```json
46	{
47	  "command": "docker",
48	  "args": [
49	    "run",
50	    "-it",
51	    "--rm",
52	    "gong-mcp"
53	  ],
54	  "env": {
55	    "GONG_ACCESS_KEY": "your_access_key_here",
56	    "GONG_ACCESS_SECRET": "your_access_secret_here"
57	  }
58	}
59	```
60	
61	4. Replace the placeholder credentials with your actual Gong API credentials from your `.env` file
62	
63	## Available Tools
64	
65	### List Calls
66	
67	Retrieves a list of Gong calls with optional date range filtering.
68	
69	```typescript
70	{
71	  name: "list_calls",
72	  description: "List Gong calls with optional date range filtering. Returns call details including ID, title, start/end times, participants, and duration.",
73	  inputSchema: {
74	    type: "object",
75	    properties: {
76	      fromDateTime: {
77	        type: "string",
78	        description: "Start date/time in ISO format (e.g. 2024-03-01T00:00:00Z)"
79	      },
80	      toDateTime: {
81	        type: "string",
82	        description: "End date/time in ISO format (e.g. 2024-03-31T23:59:59Z)"
83	      }
84	    }
85	  }
86	}
87	```
88	
89	### Retrieve Transcripts
90	
91	Retrieves detailed transcripts for specified call IDs.
92	
93	```typescript
94	{
95	  name: "retrieve_transcripts",
96	  description: "Retrieve transcripts for specified call IDs. Returns detailed transcripts including speaker IDs, topics, and timestamped sentences.",
97	  inputSchema: {
98	    type: "object",
99	    properties: {
100	      callIds: {
101	        type: "array",
102	        items: { type: "string" },
103	        description: "Array of Gong call IDs to retrieve transcripts for"
104	      }
105	    },
106	    required: ["callIds"]
107	  }
108	}
109	```
110	
111	## License
112	
113	MIT License - see LICENSE file for details
114	
115	## Contributing
116	
